  "root_notes": [
    "D6 stays open. 0 of 1 approved render attempts were used, so the ruling's closing condition ('if it fails again') did not occur, and the lane does not declare plain HTML final for D6. Both preflights timed out on nix substitution and remote-builder copy-back under host contention (load averages up to about 530), not on the fix. The direct probe shows the bundled pandoc 3.10 accepts the option that blocked D6. Whether to spend the unused attempt in a quieter host window or close D6 on the plain HTML report is an operator decision.",
